Filey changes to GridCraft's web app (Office work > Sheets): the control bridge
(apps/gridcraft-web: gridcraftControl/gridcraftOpen) that lets the Filey agent drive it with
GridCraft's own control protocol, File > Print handed to Filey (fileyPrintPdf), and the app named
"Sheets" where users see it (credit to GridCraft kept in About, no community link in the web build).
Upstream: https://github.com/storytold/gridcraft commit f1894c6da64d4326022ae644c767581816a23c2c (main). MIT OR Apache-2.0.

Build: git apply filey-control.patch; cd apps/gridcraft-web; trunk build --release
Install: node scripts/fetch-office-apps.mjs --app gridcraft --from <gridcraft>/dist/web (copy LICENSE-MIT/APACHE in first)

